- Added test for setting histogram parameters via
  'set' commands per axis

## 2023-06-09 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V11-01-00)
- Added test for histograms with user defined bins

## 2021-12-10 Ben Morgan (test03-V11-00-00)
- Change to new Markdown History format

