# History entries prior to 11.0

04th November 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-12)
- Updated for changes in the analysis category
  (G4VAnalysisReader::ReadNtuple(const G4String&) renamed
   back in GetNtuple)

29th October 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-11)
- Added option for testing ascii output: -ascii on|off (default: off)
  and updated code to take it into account
- Activated ascii output for test03-Generic-write
- Added test for new /analysis/hn|pn/get commands
  (always activated)

22nd October 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-10)
- Removed NtupleStringVector parameter - not needed
  as ntuple columns of string vector type are now
  supported in tools for all output types

19th October 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-09)
- Added option for testing directories: -dir on|off (default: on)
  and updated code to take it into account

6th October 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-08)
- Added test03-Generic-* test with the Root default output
  (compile flag TEST_ANALYSIS_GENERIC)
- Updated test for removal of g4xyz.hh analysis headers
- use auto for histograms/profiles get via GetH1() etc.

3rd September 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-07)
- Activated test for ntuple columns of string type and
  added test for ntuple columns of string vector type
- Added application parameters:
  NtupleStringVector - for switching off new test for Hdf5, Xml
    outputs where ntuple columns of string vector type are not yet
    supported in tools
  FileName - to better handle file names in Root test with many
    ntuple merging options
- Set only parameters with non-default values in CMake tests

3rd September 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-06)
- Restore back dependencies of read tests on write tests and
  the test03-Root-write-mt-merge-max test

27th August 2021 Ben Morgan (test03-V10-07-05)
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project
- Reorganise code as single project

26th August 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-04)
- Updated for changes in the analysis category
  (G4VAnalysisReader::GetNtuple(const G4String&) renamed in ReadNtuple)
- Added test for the reader GetNtuple(G4int) function

18th August 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-03)
- Migrated to G4RunManagerFactory
- Replaced test03-Root-write-mt-merge-env with test03-Root-write-mt-merge-max:
  replaced use of G4FORCENUMBEROFTHREADS env variable in CMakeLists.txt
  (now failing) with retrieving the number of set workers in main()
- Removed obsolete G4VIS_USE, G4UI_USE
- Added VerboseLevel parameter
- Removed trailing whitespaces

6th August 2021 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-07-02)
- Added G4VAnalysisReader::CloseFiles() call,
  required after removal of deleting of the analysis
  reader.

- Updated for changes in the analysis category:
  removed deleting of the analysis manager and reader,
  as this is now done by the Geant4 kernel.

18th February 2021 Ben Morgan (test03-V10-07-00)
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

30th October 2020 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-06-00)
- Updated cmake files to make test buildable outside ctest

16th November 2019 G. Cosmo (test03-V10-05-02)
- Fixed cases of implicit type conversions from size_t to G4int.

15th November 2019 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-05-01)
- Append file name with Rw/CRw/Cw extension only with Root and MT mode;
  this fixes a failure in Hdf5 read test.

14th October 2019 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-05-00)
- Updated for changes in G4VAnalysisManager:
  - Added NtupleRowMode application parameter
  - Added test03-Root-writeRwextra to test row-wise mode with an extra branch
    which became optional now
  - Added 2 histograms to test plotting with log axis scale

28th November 2017 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-04-00)
- Disabled test for invalid input to avoid confusing warning
  messages in the output.

3rd November 2017 B.Morgan (test03-V10-03-06)
- COWORKS with cmake-V10-03-43
- Check availablility of HDF5 support after location of
  Geant4 in test03-hdf5, making use of new Geant4_hdf5_FOUND
  variable to determine whether to proceed with tests.

25th October 2017 I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-03-05)
- Extended test to cover new rowWise merging option (with Root only):
  -  added -rowWise option to main (default: on) and test03-Root-writeCw
     (to test -rowWise off)

4th August 2017 Ben Morgan (test03-V10-03-04)
- Do not create test03-Hdf5 tests unless Geant4 built
  with HDF5 support.

3rd August 2017 Ben Morgan (test03-V10-03-03)
