28 October 2016, I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-02-06)
- Added option for selecting number of ntuple output files
  and tests for merging ntuples using this option:
  test03-Root-write-mt-merge1: one output file (different from the
                               histograms output file)
  test03-Root-write-mt-merge2: two output files
  test03-Root-write-mt-merge-env: run only if G4FORCENUMBEROFTHREADS is set;
                               output files = G4FORCENUMBEROFTHREADS
- Added handling the option for plotting in main
  and disabled plotting in read and new merging ntuples tests
- Initialize run from run macros and not in main

10 October 2016, I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-02-05)
