08 October 2016, I. Hrivnacova (test03-V10-02-03)
- Updated test for merging ntuples:
  - Event action is instantiated also on master
    (as their deta define the vectors refernced from ntuple)
  - Changed the file name for reading (no _tn extension)
  - Temporarily added setting of nofThreads to G4RootAnalysisManager,
    to be removed when this info is available in G4Threading

